<section class="form-panel"><div class="form-intro"><span class="panel-overline">MASTER <?= h(mb_strtoupper($def['category'])) ?></span><h2><?= h($def['title']) ?></h2><p>Isi kode yang stabil dan nama yang mudah dipahami. Perubahan pada data yang sudah digunakan akan tetap tercatat.</p></div><form method="post" action="<?= site_url('admin/master/'.$def['slug'].'/simpan') ?>"><?= csrf_input() ?><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<?= h($item['id']??'') ?>"><div class="form-grid"><label>Kode <span class="required">*</span><input name="code" value="<?= h($item['code']??'') ?>" maxlength="100" required placeholder="contoh: kode_master"></label><label>Nama <span class="required">*</span><input name="name" value="<?= h($item['name']??'') ?>" maxlength="220" required placeholder="Nama yang tampil di formulir"></label><label class="form-full">Keterangan<textarea name="description" rows="3" placeholder="Penjelasan singkat jika diperlukan"><?= h($item['description']??'') ?></textarea></label><label>Berlaku sejak<input type="date" name="effective_from" value="<?= h($item['effective_from']??'') ?>"></label><label>Berlaku sampai<input type="date" name="effective_to" value="<?= h($item['effective_to']??'') ?>"></label><label class="form-full">Dasar / catatan sumber <?= $def['source_policy']==='official'?'<span class="required">*</span>':'' ?><input name="source_note" value="<?= h(isset($item['metadata_json']) && $item['metadata_json'] ? (json_decode($item['metadata_json'],true)['source_note']??'') : '') ?>" placeholder="Nomor aturan atau sumber data"></label><label class="check-label form-full"><input type="checkbox" name="active" value="1" <?= !isset($item) || $item['active']?'checked':'' ?>> Aktif dan dapat dipilih</label></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="button button-dark" type="submit">Simpan master <span>→</span></button><a class="button button-quiet" href="<?= site_url('admin/master/'.$def['slug']) ?>">Batal</a></div></form></section>
